{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_7CED3AEC","title":"Olive dreams big","entry":"Dlg_7CED3AEC::entry","exit":"Dlg_7CED3AEC::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_2434A6F0","articyId":"72057645577607452","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Well, they fuck-ing did it, didn't they? They fucking threw me out of the movement.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, they fuck-ing did it, didn't they? They fucking threw me out of the movement.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18118","byteOffset":14741296,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_1C73DE59","articyId":"72057645577607734","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"You happened, you glorious fucking asshole. I love you. Fuck you. Let's go!","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You happened, you glorious fucking asshole. I love you. Fuck you. Let's go!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27301","byteOffset":18209696,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_144F1B85","articyId":"72057645577607749","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Ok? I'm flying bay-bee! We're out on our own now. You and me. We did it! They don't need us less than we don't need them.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ok? I'm flying bay-bee! We're out on our own now. You and me. We did it! They don't need us less than we don't need them.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19935","byteOffset":15425720,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_11D5765F","articyId":"72057645577607770","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Look, I'm happy. That's what I'm trying to say. I've left the Movement and I'm happy about it. Our speaking tour was a success. In a way. I made it.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, I'm happy. That's what I'm trying to say. I've left the Movement and I'm happy about it. Our speaking tour was a success. In a way. I made it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47065","byteOffset":32138072,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_A0A9EBF9","articyId":"72057645577607785","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"I made it. This tour was... a finale. An encore. After this, no more tours. No more speeches. No more Olive.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I made it. This tour was... a finale. An encore. After this, no more tours. No more speeches. No more Olive.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25917","byteOffset":17687032,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_3B5E8E75","articyId":"72057645577607804","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Retire from life, yeah. Take so much Joos I don't feel ANYTHING any more, then jump off something high. Or into something toxic. Whichever would be more dramatic.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Retire from life, yeah. Take so much Joos I don't feel ANYTHING any more, then jump off something high. Or into something toxic. Whichever would be more dramatic.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42322","byteOffset":30339280,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_7C402A61","articyId":"72057645577607809","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"You know... Take so much Joos I don't feel ANYTHING any more, then jump off something high. Or into something toxic. Whichever would be more dramatic.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You know... Take so much Joos I don't feel ANYTHING any more, then jump off something high. Or into something toxic. Whichever would be more dramatic.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42607","byteOffset":30447064,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_08D800EB","articyId":"72057645577607828","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Relax. I'd probably fuck it up. Or chicken out. Wouldn't be the first time! Anyway, don't look at me like that. I'm fine now. And on the stone cold. I'm in the cold light of day, and somehow, I'm ok with it. I'm doing ok.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Relax. I'd probably fuck it up. Or chicken out. Wouldn't be the first time! Anyway, don't look at me like that. I'm fine now. And on the stone cold. I'm in the cold light of day, and somehow, I'm ok with it. I'm doing ok.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41594","byteOffset":30064032,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_F5C24E72","articyId":"72057645577607842","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Look, I'm not as scribbly as I seem. I know the speeches are all for show. No one listens. No one cares. Or ALMOST no one. Sometimes, you only need one person. If one person hears you scream into the void, it's not a void any more. They're an audience, and it's a show.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, I'm not as scribbly as I seem. I know the speeches are all for show. No one listens. No one cares. Or ALMOST no one. Sometimes, you only need one person. If one person hears you scream into the void, it's not a void any more. They're an audience, and it's a show.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42441","byteOffset":30383072,"byteLength":616}},{"id":"DFr_79FEA30A","articyId":"72057645577607862","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Yeah. Maybe all I needed was... a friend.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah. Maybe all I needed was... a friend.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36379","byteOffset":28107464,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_8B831535","articyId":"72057645577607878","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"I know what I am. A drunk. A drug addict. An attention whore. A dangerously charismatic lunatic. A provocateur. An iconoclast.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I know what I am. A drunk. A drug addict. An attention whore. A dangerously charismatic lunatic. A provocateur. An iconoclast.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":5400.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50474","byteOffset":33437392,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_29BDAAF8","articyId":"72057645577607906","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Sure. I'm a lot of things! But... maybe that's fine, you know. And maybe I can keep being a lot of things if I sober up... a bit. Ease off on the Joos, booze, uppers, downers, siders.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure. I'm a lot of things! But... maybe that's fine, you know. And maybe I can keep being a lot of things if I sober up... a bit. Ease off on the Joos, booze, uppers, downers, siders.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":6000.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41813","byteOffset":30145936,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_329AFF29","articyId":"72057645577607927","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Ciders. You know? The apple drink.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ciders. You know? The apple drink.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29719","byteOffset":19123424,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_4F905DE4","articyId":"72057645577607941","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"I don't know if it helps you to know this, but... you helped me. So thanks. Now, I gotta go. I think retirement calls for a celebration. And a drink!","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't know if it helps you to know this, but... you helped me. So thanks. Now, I gotta go. I think retirement calls for a celebration. And a drink!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":7200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35728","byteOffset":27864976,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_9E5E8B7A","articyId":"72057645577607955","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Of soda! Or tea... or that unflavored stuff that's supposed to be good for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of soda! Or tea... or that unflavored stuff that's supposed to be good for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":7800.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32840","byteOffset":20307928,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_C96F056D","articyId":"72057645577607968","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Water! That's the one. Damn, they need to come up with some better branding for that. And a better name. They need a slogan too.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Water! That's the one. Damn, they need to come up with some better branding for that. And a better name. They need a slogan too.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":8400.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24670","byteOffset":17210328,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_DB94436B","articyId":"72057645577607983","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Sure! It has no slogans, no nicknames... We should be \"Chugging the clear\" \"Supping the wets.\"","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure! It has no slogans, no nicknames... We should be \"Chugging the clear\" \"Supping the wets.\"","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":9000.0,"y":-250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46111","byteOffset":31775528,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_CA19A10E","articyId":"72057645577607997","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Me too. See you later Friendo!","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me too. See you later Friendo!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":9600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22289","byteOffset":16318304,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_BD449998","articyId":"72057821671325707","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Nah, that's silly!","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nah, that's silly!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":9000.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24279","byteOffset":17062480,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_13105F7C","articyId":"72057821671325714","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"You should never attempt to work in marketing!","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You should never attempt to work in marketing!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":9000.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pa